{
    "title": "SuperQi",
    "description": "SuperQi is the first super-app in Iraq, your all-in-one lifestyle partner for seamless, cashless daily digital transactions.  \r\n\r\nSimplify your life with convenient features for money transfers, scan to pay, bill payments, e-commerce, mobile recharge, digital billing, and more inside across Iraq and the whole world. \r\n \r\n Key Features: \r\n\r\nSecure Transactions: Settle for the best advanced security measures adopted to safeguard your transactions. \r\n\r\nQi Bank Accounts Accessibility: Easily access and manage your Qi bank accounts. \r\n\r\nMini-apps: Get set for the Super-App experience designed to enhance different aspects of your daily life and discover what apps are in SuperQi. \r\n\r\nTransfer Money Easily: Quickly transfer money between your cards or accounts with ease. \r\n\r\nScan to Pay: Just a QR scan to complete your transactions swiftly using your phone. \r\n\r\nOne-Tap Bill Payments: Instantly and securely pay your bills with just a tap. \r\n\r\nWide Network of Merchants: For all your needs, access a diverse range of trusted merchants, from groceries, household essentials, to travelling, and more \r\n\r\nEffortless Organization: Handily run and organize your daily essentials in one place. \r\n\r\nAnytime, Anywhere Access: Manage your account and all other affairs from anywhere, anytime. \r\n\r\nUse SuperQi, as the super-app does integrate with your card MasterCard or Visa, consider it your digital wallet and your payment gate, you may apply to Rafidain Bank loans, installments service, and many services like money transfer from Western Union. \r\nDo it with Qi.",
    "descriptionHTML": "SuperQi is the first super-app in Iraq, your all-in-one lifestyle partner for seamless, cashless daily digital transactions.  <br><br>Simplify your life with convenient features for money transfers, scan to pay, bill payments, e-commerce, mobile recharge, digital billing, and more inside across Iraq and the whole world. <br> <br> Key Features: <br><br>Secure Transactions: Settle for the best advanced security measures adopted to safeguard your transactions. <br><br>Qi Bank Accounts Accessibility: Easily access and manage your Qi bank accounts. <br><br>Mini-apps: Get set for the Super-App experience designed to enhance different aspects of your daily life and discover what apps are in SuperQi. <br><br>Transfer Money Easily: Quickly transfer money between your cards or accounts with ease. <br><br>Scan to Pay: Just a QR scan to complete your transactions swiftly using your phone. <br><br>One-Tap Bill Payments: Instantly and securely pay your bills with just a tap. <br><br>Wide Network of Merchants: For all your needs, access a diverse range of trusted merchants, from groceries, household essentials, to travelling, and more <br><br>Effortless Organization: Handily run and organize your daily essentials in one place. <br><br>Anytime, Anywhere Access: Manage your account and all other affairs from anywhere, anytime. <br><br>Use SuperQi, as the super-app does integrate with your card MasterCard or Visa, consider it your digital wallet and your payment gate, you may apply to Rafidain Bank loans, installments service, and many services like money transfer from Western Union. <br>Do it with Qi.",
